body: "Overlap rechecked against the pinned pm SDK, CLI contracts, pm-memory, pm-context and pm-brief source. Credential refusal is an input guard; telemetry consent governs telemetry only. pm-brief owns disclosure rendering and compaction. This feature owns long-term-memory recall authorization. Reuse certified complete list reads, schema registration, native mutations and append-only history, shared SDK locks, host command registration, and host token estimates. No new core SDK capability is required; retain the existing dev pin. Deliver SDK and CLI grant/view/withdraw/manifest operations, minimized packets and text-free lineage, non-git regressions and public-copy validation. Also remove the CodeQL alert 2 shell boundary from the semantic test launcher."
